# Pairs with DeferredOnlyForCapture. Only a capture can leave its link to the durable marker; a foreground link must be awaited.
MODULE: RootDefersForegroundLink
TARGET: DeferredOnlyForCapture
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the root parks a foreground split's link that found its link gate busy
PERTURBS: RootDeferLink

--- FIND
    /\ RootDefersBusyLink
    /\ o \in CaptureOrigins
--- REPLACE
    /\ RootDefersBusyLink
    \* MUTATION: any link may be parked
--- END
